{"text":"In the sea change that this election represents, let me remind you, America, that Liberia has beat you on one score. We elected our first female president perhaps 11 years before the United States will do so. Today, I share more than a Harvard background with you. In a way, this is also a commencement year for me. Just as you end one joining today, graduates, and begin the next, so too, I will end November. As my first term as president of Liberia comes to an end, I will be standing for re-election.","words":[{"text":"In","start":0.0,"end":0.94},{"text":"the","start":0.94,"end":1.08},{"text":"sea","start":1.08,"end":1.32},{"text":"change","start":1.32,"end":2.08},{"text":"that","start":2.08,"end":3.46},{"text":"this","start":3.46,"end":3.7},{"text":"election","start":3.7,"end":4.12},{"text":"represents","start":4.12,"end":4.82,"punct":","},{"text":"let","start":6.1,"end":6.74},{"text":"me","start":6.74,"end":7.0},{"text":"remind","start":7.0,"end":7.56},{"text":"you","start":7.56,"end":7.82,"punct":","},{"text":"America","start":7.88,"end":8.28,"punct":","},{"text":"that","start":9.54,"end":9.76},{"text":"Liberia","start":9.76,"end":10.3},{"text":"has","start":10.3,"end":10.74},{"text":"beat","start":10.74,"end":11.08},{"text":"you","start":11.08,"end":11.4},{"text":"on","start":11.4,"end":11.72},{"text":"one","start":11.72,"end":12.02},{"text":"score","start":12.02,"end":12.48,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":13.82,"end":14.12},{"text":"elected","start":14.12,"end":14.68},{"text":"our","start":14.68,"end":14.94},{"text":"first","start":14.94,"end":15.42},{"text":"female","start":15.42,"end":15.88},{"text":"president","start":15.88,"end":16.28},{"text":"perhaps","start":16.28,"end":16.76},{"text":"11","start":16.76,"end":17.28},{"text":"years","start":17.28,"end":17.66},{"text":"before","start":17.66,"end":18.06},{"text":"the","start":18.06,"end":18.26},{"text":"United","start":18.26,"end":18.5},{"text":"States","start":18.5,"end":18.76},{"text":"will","st